{"pageid": 807, "title": "Victoria", "revid": 1922, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Unseen characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Victoria</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sally\" title=\"Sally\">Sally</a> † <small>(daughter)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #7</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #7</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<b>Victoria</b> is an unseen woman who lived in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> during the 2020 <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>. Her daughter, <a href=\"/wiki/Sally\" title=\"Sally\">Sally</a>, was among the missing children who were later found as corpses in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">monster</span>'s lair.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Victoria was the mother of a girl named <a href=\"/wiki/Sally\" title=\"Sally\">Sally</a>. Sally would go missing during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>, along with multiple other children. When several body parts were found in a den near the lake, parents were called to come to the school gymnasium, the only place big enough to hold all the corpses, to identify the bodies. Victoria would call <a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a> to tell her where to go.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC7&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC7-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It is currently unknown if she was among the crowd that remained at the gym when the Oscuratypes attacked.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC7-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC7_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">issue no. 7</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC9-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC9_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">issue no. 9</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:25+00:00"}